CHAPTER.VERS:
What will you

          {+}
         do in the day of solemn assembly, and in the day of the feast of Yahweh?

I found Israel like grapes in the wilderness; I saw your

          {+}
         fathers as the first-ripe in the fig-tree at its first season: but they came to Baal-peor, and consecrated themselves to the shameful thing, and became detestable things like that which they loved.
